PN,36201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786470510
OL,3,CUnidentified substance turns the River
OL,4,CIrwell green
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency is
OL,7,Finvestigating after reports an
OL,8,F'unidentified substance' has turned a
OL,9,Friver milky green in Greater
OL,10,FManchester.
OL,12,FThe contamination was first spotted in
OL,13,Fthe River Irwell in the Rectory Lane
OL,14,Farea of Radcliffe and then spread down
OL,15,Fstream in large quantities.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786470510
OL,3,CUnidentified substance turns the River
OL,4,CIrwell green
OL,6,FBury councillor Ken Simpson, who
OL,7,Frepresents the Radcliffe East ward,
OL,8,Fsaid he suspects the spill to be an
OL,9,F'organised dump' due to the 'sheer
OL,10,Fquantity' of the substance, along with
OL,11,Freports of it increasing and
OL,12,Fdecreasing at different times of day.
OL,14,FThe Environment Agency said it is
OL,15,Finvestigating the source of the
OL,16,Fsubstance and has 'taken samples for
OL,17,Fanalysis'.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786470510
OL,3,CUnidentified substance turns the River
OL,4,CIrwell green
OL,6,FUnited Utilities, which is responsible
OL,7,Ffor water and waste water services in
OL,8,Fthe region, said the spill was not
OL,9,Fcoming from its network.
OL,11,FCouncillor Simpson, who is a member of
OL,12,Fthe Radcliffe First party on Bury
OL,13,Fcouncil, reported there was 'no strong
OL,14,Fchemical smell' in the area, saying a
OL,15,Fsenior United Utilities officer called
OL,16,Fout to the site 'suspected it could be
OL,17,Fa waste milk dump'.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786470510
OL,3,CUnidentified substance turns the River
OL,4,CIrwell green
OL,6,FHe said: "I've just been to the
OL,7,Flocation of what appears to be a
OL,8,Fspillage of an unidentified substance
OL,9,Finto the River Irwell alongside the
OL,10,Fnew footbridge on Rectory Lane.
OL,12,F"United Utilities are on scene but
OL,13,Fhave already confirmed it isn't one of
OL,14,Ftheir outlets but a private drain from
OL,15,Fone of Radcliffe's ancient "goits"
OL,16,Fwhich now run beneath local housing.
OL,26,@nD@JOUwD@\OUwD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786470510
OL,3,CUnidentified substance turns the River
OL,4,CIrwell green
OL,6,F"Due to the sheer quantity of whatever
OL,7,Fthis substance is and that we have had
OL,8,Freports of it increasing and
OL,9,Fdecreasing at different times of day
OL,10,Fit appears to be an organised dump of
OL,11,Fsome kind (...)
OL,13,F"The spillage has immediately diffused
OL,14,Finto the downstream river completely
OL,15,Fchanging its colour to a milky green
OL,16,Fcolour. I know this is obvious but my
OL,17,Fadvice is to keep children and pets
OL,18,Fout of the water downstream until we
OL,19,Fhave confirmation it is safe."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@KpmsD@OpnuD@AOU{D@^O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786470510
OL,3,CUnidentified substance turns the River
OL,4,CIrwell green
OL,6,FResidents say this is not the first
OL,7,Ftime unidentified substances have
OL,8,Fcontaminated the waters in that area.
OL,9,FOne person said spills 'happen a lot
OL,10,Fthere', adding this incident 'looked
OL,11,Fvery big'.
OL,13,FAnother added: "It's just awful, even
OL,14,Fif it's 'just' milk it will have a
OL,15,Fmassive impact and strip the affected
OL,16,Farea of oxygen. Britain's rivers are
OL,17,Fin a terrible state."
OL,19,FThe Environment Agency confirmed it
OL,20,Freceived a report of a similar
OL,21,Fincident last month.
OL,26,@uD@POUyD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786470510
OL,3,CUnidentified substance turns the River
OL,4,CIrwell green
OL,6,FA spokesman for the organisation said:
OL,7,F"We take our role in cleaning up our
OL,8,Frivers, lakes and seas seriously. We
OL,9,Fare investigating the source of this
OL,10,Fwhite substance and have also taken
OL,11,Fsamples for analysis.
OL,13,F"Any suspected pollution incidents
OL,14,Fshould be reported as soon as possible
OL,15,Fto our 24/7 hotline on 0800 80 70 60,
OL,16,For online."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUxD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786470510
OL,3,CUnidentified substance turns the River
OL,4,CIrwell green
OL,6,FA United Utilities spokesman said:
OL,7,F"Following reports of pollution in the
OL,8,FRiver Irwell in Radcliffe on Saturday,
OL,9,Four teams inspected our assets and
OL,10,Fconfirmed the substance was not linked
OL,11,Fto our network."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/8
